    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the Battlefields and Collect Weapons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the dust of battle settles, you arrive to aid the wounded soldiers of Danburg. It seems no danger lurks on the horizon. Weapons are scattered everywhere\u2014swords, armor, helmets\u2026 Take advantage of this great opportunity! Decide who to help and who to rob! Observe your surroundings, collect weapons, gather armor, sort them and pick the best ones. Once you\u2019ve gathered enough gear, head to the workshop. Just remember\u2014your cart can\u2019t carry everything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/2a66f898f340f87ff5652255bc724750.poster.avif?t=1753269295\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/2a66f898f340f87ff5652255bc724750.webm?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/2a66f898f340f87ff5652255bc724750.mp4?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Feel the Spirit of the Forge:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your hammer! Cut, forge, and dismantle what you\u2019ve brought back from the battlefield! You have at your disposal an anvil, furnace, grindstone, and much more! Many challenges await you on the path to becoming a master blacksmith. You\u2019ll need to melt down, break apart, and forge many weapons to reach the mastery you seek!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/95f7c0c767de79354d5e237e3a642121.poster.avif?t=1753269295\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/95f7c0c767de79354d5e237e3a642121.webm?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/95f7c0c767de79354d5e237e3a642121.mp4?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell your work:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All your efforts support your comrades but also help you to make some extra money. Help your village and protect your workshop by using powerful skills that you have. Dive into the world of enhancement and empower people to win the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/484f63435aa53cf81e063836118b2726.poster.avif?t=1753269295\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/484f63435aa53cf81e063836118b2726.webm?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/484f63435aa53cf81e063836118b2726.mp4?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve puzzles in additional quest:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you get bored with the main missions you can do other tasks based on interesting and addictive mini-games. Open castles, shoot crossbows and much more. Gather experience and expand your skills, which will allow you to immerse yourself even more deeply into the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/e197dcaaa12c66808fa3ccec121b9b8d.poster.avif?t=1753269295\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/e197dcaaa12c66808fa3ccec121b9b8d.webm?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/e197dcaaa12c66808fa3ccec121b9b8d.mp4?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>Discover the story Behind the Kingdom of Danburg:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of mysteries and intrigue. Look around carefully\u2014some townsfolk may have interesting stories to share! Listen to conversations drifting through the streets of Danburg, let yourself be captivated by this beautiful city, and dive into the challenging world of the Iron <br>Coast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/6045ed22e466d52b588ad0c0da3e43d0.poster.avif?t=1753269295\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/6045ed22e466d52b588ad0c0da3e43d0.webm?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/6045ed22e466d52b588ad0c0da3e43d0.mp4?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>Discover more cities and battlefields:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The entire kingdom covers huge tracts of land. Some of these are dangerous war zones where scores of knights die every day. On the other hand, there are also huge merchant cities marveling at their amazing architecture. Embark on a journey and reach the remotest corners of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/9e177e7feb5cb53485fb9384c1e2703b.poster.avif?t=1753269295\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/9e177e7feb5cb53485fb9384c1e2703b.webm?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/9e177e7feb5cb53485fb9384c1e2703b.mp4?t=1753269295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
